OL,3,GNEWSAFerry schedule opens up new trade
OL,4,Alink to France
OL,5,
OL,6,FA long-awaited winter ferry schedule
OL,7,Fincludes a new route to northern France
OL,8,Fwhich the government says will provide
OL,9,F"new opportunities" for travel and
OL,10,Ftrade.
OL,12,FIn addition to the Cherbourg route,
OL,13,Ffrom November Brittany Ferries' service
OL,14,Fto Portsmouth is also set to increase
OL,15,Ffrom six days a week to daily, the
OL,16,FStates of Guernsey said.
OL,18,FThe schedule includes a combination of
OL,19,Fdirect sailings to Portsmouth, as well
OL,20,Fas a new triangular route via Cherbourg
OL,21,Fto Portsmouth.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
